        "en": "ai-website-cloner-template is an open-source tool that clones any website with a single command using AI coding agents. Its core innovation is leveraging large language models to automate reverse-engineering of web pages into clean, reusable code. Developers can instantly duplicate entire sites—including structure, styles, and interactivity—for learning, customization, or rapid prototyping. Simply provide a URL and let the AI handle the rest.",
        "zh": "ai-website-cloner-template 是一个开源项目，通过AI编码代理实现一键克隆任意网站。其技术核心是借助大语言模型自动逆向分析网页，生成结构清晰、可直接运行的代码。开发者只需提供目标网址，即可获得包含布局、样式和交互的完整项目副本，方便学习、定制或作为新项目起点。这一工具大幅降低了复制和改造现代网页的门槛。",
        "es": "ai-website-cloner-template is an open-source tool that clones any website with a single command using AI coding agents. Its core innovation is leveraging large language models to automate reverse-engineering of web pages into clean, reusable code. Developers can instantly duplicate entire sites—including structure, styles, and interactivity—for learning, customization, or rapid prototyping. Simply provide a URL and let the AI handle the rest.",
