      "summaries": {
        "en": "DESIGN.md is a specification that lets you describe a visual identity in a structured document for AI coding agents. Instead of relying on scattered style prompts, it gives agents a persistent, shared understanding of your design system—colors, typography, spacing, and more. By placing a DESIGN.md file in your project, you enable agents to generate UI code that consistently follows your brand guidelines. It's like a design system as code for AI collaborators.",
        "zh": "DESIGN.md 是一种格式规范，让开发者用结构化文档向AI编码代理描述视觉身份。传统方式下，AI生成UI时缺乏对设计系统的统一理解，导致风格混乱。它通过一个DESIGN.md文件集中定义颜色、字体、间距等设计令牌，使所有代理共享同一套设计语言。使用方法：在项目根目录放置DESIGN.md，AI代理（如GitHub Copilot）即可自动读取并遵循规范生成界面代码。这相当于把设计系统转化为AI可读的活文档，确保多代理协作时品牌一致性。",
        "es": "DESIGN.md is a specification that lets you describe a visual identity in a structured document for AI coding agents. Instead of relying on scattered style prompts, it gives agents a persistent, shared understanding of your design system—colors, typography, spacing, and more. By placing a DESIGN.md file in your project, you enable agents to generate UI code that consistently follows your brand guidelines. It's like a design system as code for AI collaborators.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "design.md gives teams a dependable path to production-ready AI tooling.",
          "what": "DESIGN.md is a specification that lets you describe a visual identity in a structured document for AI coding agents. Instead of relying on scattered style prompts, it gives agents a persistent, shared understanding of your design system—colors, typography, spacing, and more. By placing a DESIGN.md file in your project, you enable agents to generate UI code that consistently follows your brand guidelines. It's like a design system as code for AI collaborators.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/google-labs-code/design.md for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
