        "zh": "Hiring-Agent 是一个开源 AI 工具，用于自动评估和评分简历，解决招聘初期筛选效率低、主观性强的问题。它基于 Python 语言，利用大语言模型分析简历内容与职位描述的匹配度，输出客观排名。核心优势在于可定制性：用户能自定义评分权重和评估维度，并轻松集成到现有招聘流程中。典型应用场景包括海量简历初筛、减少人为偏见以及提升招聘团队效率。开发者可基于 MIT 协议自由修改和部署。",
        "es": "Hiring-Agent is an open-source AI tool that automates resume evaluation and scoring, streamlining the initial screening process for recruiters. Built with Python and using a language model, it analyzes resumes against job descriptions to provide objective rankings. Its key strength is customization—users can adapt scoring criteria and integrate it into existing HR pipelines. Typical use cases include high-volume candidate screening, unbiased shortlisting, and reducing manual effort in hiring.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "hiring-agent gives teams a dependable path to production-ready AI tooling.",
          "what": "Hiring-Agent is an open-source AI tool that automates resume evaluation and scoring, streamlining the initial screening process for recruiters. Built with Python and using a language model, it analyzes resumes against job descriptions to provide objective rankings. Its key strength is customization—users can adapt scoring criteria and integrate it into existing HR pipelines. Typical use cases include high-volume candidate screening, unbiased shortlisting, and reducing manual effort in hiring.",
