      "summaries": {
        "en": "no-mistakes is a lightweight Go tool that ensures error-free git pushes by automatically enforcing pre-push checks. It integrates seamlessly into existing workflows, running validations like linters or tests before commits are pushed. This prevents broken code from reaching remote repositories, saving time and reducing CI failures. Developers can customize checks via a simple configuration file, making it adaptable to any project's quality standards. Ideal for teams wanting to maintain code quality without manual oversight.",
        "zh": "no-mistakes 是一款轻量级的 Go 语言工具，旨在确保 git push 操作无误。它通过在推送前自动执行预定义检查（如代码规范、测试等），阻止不合规代码进入远程仓库。核心设计是作为预推送钩子集成到现有工作流中，无需额外学习成本。用户可通过简单的配置文件自定义检查规则，灵活适配不同项目的质量要求。典型场景包括团队协作中自动化代码审查、减少 CI 失败、提升开发效率。对于追求代码质量的 Go 项目团队，这是一个低门槛且实用的基础设施。",
        "es": "no-mistakes is a lightweight Go tool that ensures error-free git pushes by automatically enforcing pre-push checks. It integrates seamlessly into existing workflows, running validations like linters or tests before commits are pushed. This prevents broken code from reaching remote repositories, saving time and reducing CI failures. Developers can customize checks via a simple configuration file, making it adaptable to any project's quality standards. Ideal for teams wanting to maintain code quality without manual oversight.",
        "sections": {
